ervices-drhs/tennis-and-pickleball-courts","source_title":"Tennis and pickleball courts | City of Rochester","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor courts are public and free on a first-come, first-served basis; equipment is not stated as provided.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"cobbs-hill-tennis-courts","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Cobb's Hill Park Tennis Courts","title":"Hit at Cobb's Hill","subtitle":"Cobb's Hill Park, 80 Culver Road","notes":"Pack racquets and balls, claim an unreserved court, and pair a short rally with a walk through the surrounding park afterward.","short_summary":"Six free public tennis courts at Cobb's Hill Park.","evidence_claim":"The City lists six tennis courts at Cobb's Hill Park and says its outdoor courts are free to use on a first-come, first-served basis.","source_url":"https://www.cityofrochester.gov/departments/department-recreation-and-human-services-drhs/tennis-and-pickleball-courts","source_title":"Tennis and pickleball courts | City of Rochester","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor courts are public and free on a first-come, first-served basis; equipment is not stated as provided.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"highland-park","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Highland Park","title":"Stroll Highland Park","subtitle":"450 Highland Avenue","notes":"Pick a route through the arboretum, gardens, and paths, then stop at a bench or picnic area for a low-key conversation outdoors.","short_summary":"A landscaped city park with paths, benches, gardens, and picnic areas.","evidence_claim":"The City lists Highland Park’s hiking paths, benches, gardens, and picnic areas among its amenities.","source_url":"https://www.cityofrochester.gov/locations/highland-park","source_title":"Highland Park | City of Rochester","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City parks are free and open to the public; this applies to the park grounds, not separately operated attractions or rentals.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"washington-grove","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Washington Grove","title":"Walk Washington Grove","subtitle":"Beside Cobb's Hill Reservoir","notes":"Stay on the winding trails, keep bikes out of the grove, and keep dogs leashed if one joins your group for the walk.","short_summary":"A 100-acre old-growth forest sanctuary with hiking trails.","evidence_claim":"The City describes Washington Grove as a 100-acre sanctuary with hiking trails and states that bikes are prohibited and dogs must be leashed.","source_url":"https://www.cityofrochester.gov/locations/cobbs-hill-park-and-washington-grove","source_title":"Cobb's Hill Park and Washington Grove | City of Rochester","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City parks are free and open to the public; follow the grove’s trail rules, including no bicycles.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"maplewood-park-rose-garden","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Maplewood Park and Rose Garden","title":"Visit the Maplewood Rose Garden","subtitle":"Maplewood Park, 250 Maplewood Avenue","notes":"Walk through the rose garden and nearby Riverway Trail, then use the open space for a relaxed outdoor catch-up without booking a facility.","short_summary":"A city park and rose garden beside the Genesee Riverway Trail.","evidence_claim":"The City identifies Maplewood Park’s Rose Garden and the Genesee Riverway Trail as features of this park.","source_url":"https://www.cityofrochester.gov/loc